> Could these be combined to linear_page_index(vma, addr) >> order?

So this is:

	(x >> order) + (y >> order)

And linear_page_index(vma, addr) >> order is:

	(x + y) >> order

Consider:

	order = 1, x = 0b11, y = 0b01

	(x    >> order) + (y    >> order) =
	(0b11 >> 1    ) + (0b01 >> 1    ) =
	0b1             + 0               =
	1

	(x    + y   ) >> order =
	(0b11 + 0b01) >> 1     =
	(0b100      ) >> 1     =
	2

They are not equivalent - the carry bit changes the result.

